pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  这一页区分仿真、静止实机和运动实机三类证据。仿真建图已经可重复；实机组合栈和单垄验证已经有结果；正式小花园地图、独立真值和 RTK 仍未完成。
elements:
  - elementId: p4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 32, 840, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: X3 Pro + EKF + SLAM 已跑通，正式场地证据未补齐
  - elementId: p4-meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 70, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$muted"
      text: 传感器链路：X3 Pro /scan → SLAM Toolbox；轮速 + ICM20948 → robot_localization EKF
  - elementId: p4-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 98, 840, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p4-tf-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 132, 250, 26]
    content:
      style: "$section"
      fontSize: 18
      text: TF 归属
  - elementId: p4-tf
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 170, 250, 116]
